{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_83E1CA1C","title":"Banor further revelations","entry":"Dlg_83E1CA1C::entry","exit":"Dlg_83E1CA1C::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_43E1274A","articyId":"72057645577592169","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Well boss, looks like Thaddeus might really be going through with it. That's what you're coming to talk to me about, right?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well boss, looks like Thaddeus might really be going through with it. That's what you're coming to talk to me about, right?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24265","byteOffset":17056816,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_152BFCF2","articyId":"72057645577592183","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"He sent me a message. Said I could trust you. Somewhat. There ain't much I can tell you, but what I know I'm happy to share.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He sent me a message. Said I could trust you. Somewhat. There ain't much I can tell you, but what I know I'm happy to share.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49289","byteOffset":32988976,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_488C7610","articyId":"72057645577592204","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"In his head? All around the universe. In reality? Probably Sang Ha. Everything he needed was there.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In his head? All around the universe. In reality? Probably Sang Ha. Everything he needed was there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25852","byteOffset":17663056,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_F45580D4","articyId":"72057645577592211","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"He tried to keep his mind working by trimming it down, but eventually the process stopped working. He went to Sang Ha to find help.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He tried to keep his mind working by trimming it down, but eventually the process stopped working. He went to Sang Ha to find help.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46783","byteOffset":32030296,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_ED06BA62","articyId":"72057645577592224","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Looking for the other Doctor. Or part of himself that can still remember the other Doctor. Thaddeus's mind is failing. Filling. Now Egress has broken down, he needs another transmitter, and a fresh consciousness to fill with memories.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Looking for the other Doctor. Or part of himself that can still remember the other Doctor. Thaddeus's mind is failing. Filling. Now Egress has broken down, he needs another transmitter, and a fresh consciousness to fill with memories.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43274","byteOffset":30699880,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_8B8264DA","articyId":"72057645577592240","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"I can't say any more. But it doesn't matter. He's going to tell you himself soon. one way or another, the experiment is almost over. Good luck boss.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can't say any more. But it doesn't matter. He's going to tell you himself soon. one way or another, the experiment is almost over. Good luck boss.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34978","byteOffset":25592424,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_51BB0322","articyId":"72057645577592176","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yes.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes.","TextSheVersion":"Yes.","TextTheyVersion":"Yes."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":925.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18197","byteOffset":14771408,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_1879F5D4","articyId":"72057645577592190","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What did Thaddeus do?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What did Thaddeus do?","TextSheVersion":"What did Thaddeus do?","TextTheyVersion":"What did Thaddeus do?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40446","byteOffset":29629344,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_B469A8FD","articyId":"72057645577592196","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Where did Thaddeus go?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Where did Thaddeus go?","TextSheVersion":"Where did Thaddeus go?","TextTheyVersion":"Where did Thad